<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>領収書発行依頼</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Hiragino Sans', 'Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    
    .email-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b35 0%, #f7931e 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .header .icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: block;
    }
    
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    
    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    
    .message {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-left: 4px solid #ff6b35;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    
    .invoice-details {
      background: #fff3e0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ffe0b2;
    }
    
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #ff6b35;
    }
    
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #495057;
    }
    
    .detail-value {
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 25px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
    }
    
    .company-info {
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .note {
      background: #e3f2fd;
      border: 1px solid #90caf9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      color: #1565c0;
    }
    
    .steps {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .step {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-left: 25px;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .step::before {
      content: counter(step-counter);
      counter-increment: step-counter;
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      background: #ff6b35;
      color: white;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .steps {
      counter-reset: step-counter;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        background: #f8f9fa;
      }
      
      .container {
        padding: 10px;
      }
      
      .content {
        padding: 25px 20px;
      }
      
      .header {
        padding: 25px 20px;
      }
      
      .header h1 {
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      
      .header .icon {
        font-size: 36px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="email-card">
      <div class="header">
        <span class="icon">📋</span>
        <h1>領収書発行依頼</h1>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>様
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
          <p>いつもお世話になっております。</p>
          <p>下記インセンティブ請求書について、領収書発行のお手続きをお願いいたします。</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="invoice-details">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #ff6b35; text-align: center;">📋 請求書詳細</h3>
          
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">請求書番号:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><strong><%= @invoice.invoice_number %></strong></span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">対象月:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= @invoice.target_month_display %></span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">請求日:</span>
            <span class="detail-value"><%= @invoice.invoice_date&.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") %></span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-label">請求金額:</span>
            <span class="detail-value">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(@invoice.total_amount) %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="steps">
          <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333;">📝 お手続きの流れ</h4>
          <div class="step">ログインしてください</div>
          <div class="step">メニューの「インセンティブ」->「請求書管理」ページにアクセスしてください</div>
          <div class="step">「インセンティブ請求書履歴」ボタンをクリックしてください</div>
          <div class="step">右端の操作ボタンの「領収書発行」クリックしてください</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="note">
          <strong>📌 ご注意</strong><br>
          領収書発行には数営業日お時間をいただく場合がございます。発行完了次第、改めてご連絡いたします。
        </div>
        
        <p>ご不明な点がございましたら、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer">
        <div class="company-info">
          <strong><%= @invoice_recipient.name %></strong><br>
          〒<%= @invoice_recipient.postal_code %> <%= @invoice_recipient.address %><br>
          TEL: <%= @invoice_recipient.tel %><br>
          Email: <%= ENV['ADMIN_EMAIL'] || 'info@abt-saisei.com' %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>